@contents

@ifnottex
@node Top
@top cgra

@command{cgra} drives a Coarse-Grained Reconfigurable Array from the host over
a serial link (or an in-process emulator). This manual is the reference for the
tool, its @file{.cgra} configuration language, and how they map onto the fabric.

@insertcopying
@end ifnottex

