* Standard Library:: The bundled modes and pipelines.
* Dataflow::         How modes map onto the array.
* Protocol::         The UART wire protocol, in brief.
* Environment::      Environment variables.
* Examples::         Worked examples.
* Files::            Where configuration and state live.
* Index::            Concept and command index.
@end menu

